# Assign Sheet

::summary
The task assign sheet — Assign (action bar) and the Assignee tile open the SAME sheet: popover anchored to the control on wide, full-width sheet at mobile. Two labeled sections (Workspace members / Agent) plus Unassigned; the current assignee renders accent-filled with a check, the same selector treatment as the doc menu's General access group. Assigning to Surfy is the hand-off into agent execution — which the Token cost tile then meters.
::

::modal[name=assign title="Assign" width=300 placement=anchored anchor=assign-button dismissible=true]

:::toolbar
- text[value="Workspace members"]
:::

:::row[icon=login state=current action=assignTask href=#]
K. Brady Davis
Owner · current assignee — accent-filled with check
:::

:::row[icon=login action=assignTask href=#]
Danny Pappageorge
Member
:::

:::toolbar
- text[value="Agent"]
:::

:::row[icon=surfy-fin action=assignTaskToSurfy href=#]
Surfy
Agent — runs the task and reports back
:::

:::row[icon=login action=unassignTask href=#]
Unassigned
Leave in the backlog
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
